Package: r8125-dkms
Version: @PACKAGE_VERSION@
Priority: optional
Section: non-free/kernel
Maintainer: Aethersailor <noreply@github.com>
Architecture: all
Depends: dkms
Recommends: proxmox-default-headers | proxmox-headers | pve-headers | linux-headers-amd64
Provides: r8125-dkms
Conflicts: realtek-r8125-dkms
Replaces: realtek-r8125-dkms
Homepage: https://github.com/Aethersailor/r8125-driver-packages
Description: DKMS source for the Realtek r8125 network driver
 This package provides DKMS source for the Realtek r8125 2.5G Ethernet
 driver. It is built from mirrored Realtek source archives with DKMS build
 options tuned for throughput, latency, and Proxmox VE/Debian use.
